# Images: NEVER push decorative/screenshot raster images to GitHub.
# Carve-outs (these are functional code inputs, not docs/screenshots):
#   assets/templates/**/*.png       — gocv template matcher loads at runtime
#   assets/grab/de_region.png        — dev-only screenshot tool input (cmd/grab_one)
#   assets/grab/full_screen.png      — dev-only screenshot tool input (cmd/find_anchors, cmd/capture_digits, cmd/grab_one)
#   internal/game/testdata/screen_ocr.png     — Go test fixture (loot_test.go)
#   internal/game/testdata/screen_victory.png — Go test fixture (loot_test.go)
#
# If you add a new test fixture or grab-tool input, append it here explicitly
# rather than dropping a PNG into those dirs — explicit list prevents an
# accidental debug screenshot from being silently tracked.
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.bmp
**/*.tiff
!**/assets/templates/**/*.png
!assets/grab/de_region.png
!assets/grab/full_screen.png
!internal/game/testdata/screen_ocr.png
!internal/game/testdata/screen_victory.png
assets/templates/debug/

# Auto-generated bindings (do not commit)
web/wailsjs/
web/dist/
web/node_modules/
web/package.json.md5

# Misc
.agents/
